# Milestone 2 (X2): the Undo / Redo UI on the clean "linear" fixture, dark then light, 1280x720. The toolbar's
# Undo / Redo buttons (tooltips are not part of a capture), the history popover under the Undo chevron, the
# "Undone" badge, the restore confirmation and the toast actions. Compare with spec 21 section 5.1.
# The scenario creates branches and a commit: run it against a fresh sandbox (new-sandbox.ps1 -Force) every time.
resize 1280x720
set theme dark
open repository linear
wait idle
shot x2-01-toolbar-nothing-to-undo
# Three recorded operations: a branch, a commit, a second branch.
undo demo branch feature-x
wait idle
undo demo stage notes.txt
wait idle
undo demo commit Add notes
wait idle
undo demo branch feature-y
wait idle
shot x2-02-toolbar-undo-enabled-with-toast
undo history open
wait idle
shot x2-03-history-popover
undo history close
# Undo the last branch: Redo becomes available, the toast offers Redo.
undo
wait idle
shot x2-04-after-undo
undo history open
wait idle
shot x2-05-history-undone-badge
# Restore to before the commit: the confirmation lists what changes; declining it changes nothing.
undo history restore 1 before
wait 600
shot x2-06-restore-confirmation
close dialog
wait idle
redo
wait idle
set theme light
undo history open
wait idle
shot x2-07-history-popover-light
undo history close
set theme dark
assert no error
